{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1795031715471629503,"compiled_state":{"alias":"livid-painful-mosquito","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"7bc5be82db54041bc6e9ec998c1018a2e5d2eee8c903bad5d75df1ac77c414b1","event_uuid":"7596409a-4274-44fa-b478-3ed641e1b0b8","position":{"commit_sha":"08895ddbda43715a9c2d7cf2f98f74bbfb2ad513","position":"1795031706910162743-7596409a-4274-44fa-b478-3ed641e1b0b8"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"5527dbfee8113326c77df26dd00ff35a62744dc39faa40bad964d88064de78b7","event_uuid":"f7becc49-b9dd-4319-bfed-46c3d0d3beab","position":{"commit_sha":"ef06eae690be009ab73e6a56302f6e7e9366679b","position":"1795031715471629502-f7becc49-b9dd-4319-bfed-46c3d0d3beab"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1795031706910162743,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"f7becc49-b9dd-4319-bfed-46c3d0d3beab","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"9660-c4b0-1b57-4849"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nDiscovered from obtuse-phenocryst-verdin. `src/rebar/_store/gitutil.py:199` and `:229` run git with `text=True` and no `encoding`, and `src/rebar/attest/sshsig.py:51` runs `ssh -V` the same way. On Windows the output is decoded as cp1252, so non-ASCII git output (commit subjects, paths, ticket titles) is garbled or raises `UnicodeDecodeError` on bytes cp1252 leaves undefined (0x81/0x8D/0x8F/0x90/0x9D). Found as `EncodingWarning` under `PYTHONWARNDEFAULTENCODING=1` while running the text-encoding Windows-sweep tests; no current sweep failure is attributed to them.\n\n## Approach\n\nPass `encoding=\"utf-8\"` (git emits UTF-8 by default; `errors=\"replace\"` where output is diagnostic only) at each site, with a Linux-gate test that runs the call under `-X warn_default_encoding -W error::EncodingWarning`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Each listed call names its encoding, and a regression test fails on the pre-fix code.\n- [ ] `make verify` passes.\n","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["windows","portability"],"ticket_id":"39d8-253b-8d41-4f88","ticket_type":"bug","title":"git and ssh subprocess output decoded with the locale codec (gitutil, sshsig)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["7596409a-4274-44fa-b478-3ed641e1b0b8","f7becc49-b9dd-4319-bfed-46c3d0d3beab"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795031715471629503,"uuid":"633a5afa-4a78-4613-b667-cbc363d70420"}
